{"id":"10-1-4","courseId":"10","chapterNumber":"1.4","title":"Potensar med rasjonale eksponentar","description":"Potensar med brøkeksponentar og samanhengen med røter.","estimatedMinutes":45,"competenceGoals":["bruke variablar og formlar til å uttrykkje samanhengar i praktiske situasjonar"],"content":[{"id":"10-1-4-text-1","type":"text","content":"Potensar med brøkeksponentar gir oss ein elegant måte å skrive røter på. Dette knyttar saman potensrekning og rotutdraging."},{"id":"10-1-4-def-1","type":"definition","title":"Rasjonale eksponentar","content":"Ein potens med brøkeksponent definerast slik:\n\n$$a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$$\n\n$$a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m} = (\\sqrt[n]{a})^m$$\n\nFor døme:\n- $8^{\\frac{1}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$\n- $27^{\\frac{2}{3}} = (\\sqrt[3]{27})^2 = 3^2 = 9$"},{"id":"10-1-4-eks-1","type":"example","title":"Døme 1: Skrive om mellom røter og potensar","problem":"Skriv om:\na) $\\sqrt{5}$ som potens\nb) $\\sqrt[3]{x^2}$ som potens\nc) $x^{\\frac{3}{4}}$ som rot","solution":"a) $\\sqrt{5} = 5^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\n\nb) $\\sqrt[3]{x^2} = x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$\n\nc) $x^{\\frac{3}{4}} = \\sqrt[4]{x^3}$"},{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-1","number":"1.4.1","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Skriv om mellom røter og potenser.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Skriv $\\sqrt[3]{7}$ som potens","solution":"$\\sqrt[3]{7} = 7^{\\frac{1}{3}}$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$7^{\\frac{1}{3}}$","$7^3$","$7^{\\frac{3}{1}}$","$3^{\\frac{1}{7}}$"]},{"label":"b","task":"Skriv $\\sqrt[4]{x^3}$ som potens","solution":"$\\sqrt[4]{x^3} = x^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$x^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","$x^{\\frac{4}{3}}$","$x^{12}$","$x^{\\frac{1}{4}}$"]},{"label":"c","task":"Skriv $a^{\\frac{2}{5}}$ med rottegn","solution":"$a^{\\frac{2}{5}} = \\sqrt[5]{a^2}$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$\\sqrt[5]{a^2}$","$\\sqrt[2]{a^5}$","$\\sqrt{a^5}$","$\\sqrt[5]{a}$"]},{"label":"d","task":"Skriv $\\sqrt{x^3}$ som potens","solution":"$\\sqrt{x^3} = x^{\\frac{3}{2}}$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$x^{\\frac{3}{2}}$","$x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$","$x^6$","$x^{\\frac{1}{2}}$"]}],"solution":"a) 7^(1/3), b) x^(3/4), c) ⁵√(a²), d) x^(3/2)","hints":["Bruk samanhengen: n-te rot = eksponent 1/n"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-eks-2","type":"example","title":"Døme 2: Rekne ut potensar med brøkeksponent","problem":"Rekn ut utan kalkulator:\na) $16^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\nb) $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$\nc) $81^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"a) $16^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{16} = 4$\n\nb) $8^{\\frac{2}{3}} = (\\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$\n\nc) $81^{\\frac{3}{4}} = (\\sqrt[4]{81})^3 = 3^3 = 27$"},{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-2","number":"1.4.2","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rekn ut utan kalkulator.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Rekn ut $25^{\\frac{1}{2}}$","solution":"$25^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{25} = 5$","answer":5},{"label":"b","task":"Rekn ut $27^{\\frac{1}{3}}$","solution":"$27^{\\frac{1}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{27} = 3$","answer":3},{"label":"c","task":"Rekn ut $16^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"$16^{\\frac{3}{4}} = (\\sqrt[4]{16})^3 = 2^3 = 8$","answer":8},{"label":"d","task":"Rekn ut $32^{\\frac{2}{5}}$","solution":"$32^{\\frac{2}{5}} = (\\sqrt[5]{32})^2 = 2^2 = 4$","answer":4}],"solution":"a) 5, b) 3, c) 8, d) 4","hints":["Ta roten først, deretter potensen"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-def-2","type":"definition","title":"Potensreglar","content":"Potensreglane gjeld også for rasjonale eksponentar:\n\n- $a^m \\cdot a^n = a^{m+n}$\n- $\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}$\n- $(a^m)^n = a^{m \\cdot n}$\n- $(ab)^n = a^n \\cdot b^n$"},{"id":"10-1-4-eks-3","type":"example","title":"Døme 3: Forenkle med potensreglar","problem":"Forenkle:\na) $x^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{3}{2}}$\nb) $\\frac{a^{\\frac{5}{3}}}{a^{\\frac{2}{3}}}$\nc) $(x^{\\frac{2}{3}})^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"a) $x^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{3}{2}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{2}} = x^2$\n\nb) $\\frac{a^{\\frac{5}{3}}}{a^{\\frac{2}{3}}} = a^{\\frac{5}{3} - \\frac{2}{3}} = a^1 = a$\n\nc) $(x^{\\frac{2}{3}})^{\\frac{3}{4}} = x^{\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{x}$"},{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-3","number":"1.4.3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Forenkle uttrykkja.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Forenkle $x^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{1}{3}}$","solution":"$x^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{1}{3}} = x^{\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{3}} = x^1 = x$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$x$","$x^{\\frac{2}{9}}$","$x^2$","$x^{\\frac{1}{3}}$"]},{"label":"b","task":"Forenkle $\\frac{a^{\\frac{7}{4}}}{a^{\\frac{3}{4}}}$","solution":"$\\frac{a^{\\frac{7}{4}}}{a^{\\frac{3}{4}}} = a^{\\frac{7}{4} - \\frac{3}{4}} = a^1 = a$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$a$","$a^{\\frac{10}{4}}$","$a^{\\frac{4}{4}}$","$a^{\\frac{21}{16}}$"]},{"label":"c","task":"Forenkle $(y^{\\frac{4}{5}})^{\\frac{5}{2}}$","solution":"$(y^{\\frac{4}{5}})^{\\frac{5}{2}} = y^{\\frac{4}{5} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2}} = y^2$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$y^2$","$y^{\\frac{9}{7}}$","$y^{\\frac{20}{10}}$","$y^{\\frac{8}{25}}$"]},{"label":"d","task":"Forenkle $x^{\\frac{3}{4}} \\cdot x^{-\\frac{1}{4}}$","solution":"$x^{\\frac{3}{4}} \\cdot x^{-\\frac{1}{4}} = x^{\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{4}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{x}$","multipleChoiceOptions":["$\\sqrt{x}$","$x$","$x^{-\\frac{2}{4}}$","$x^{\\frac{4}{4}}$"]}],"solution":"a) x, b) a, c) y², d) √x","hints":["Bruk potenslover: legg saman eksponentar ved multiplikasjon"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-eks-4","type":"example","title":"Døme 4: Negative eksponentar","problem":"Rekn ut:\na) $4^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$\nb) $27^{-\\frac{2}{3}}$","solution":"a) $4^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{1}{4^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4}} = \\frac{1}{2}$\n\nb) $27^{-\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{1}{27^{\\frac{2}{3}}} = \\frac{1}{(\\sqrt[3]{27})^2} = \\frac{1}{3^2} = \\frac{1}{9}$"},{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-oppg-4","number":"1.4.4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Rekn ut utan kalkulator.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Rekn ut $9^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$","solution":"$9^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9}} = \\frac{1}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"1/3"},{"label":"b","task":"Rekn ut $8^{-\\frac{1}{3}}$","solution":"$8^{-\\frac{1}{3}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{8}} = \\frac{1}{2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/2"},{"label":"c","task":"Rekn ut $16^{-\\frac{3}{4}}$","solution":"$16^{-\\frac{3}{4}} = \\frac{1}{16^{\\frac{3}{4}}} = \\frac{1}{8}$","expressionAnswer":"1/8"},{"label":"d","task":"Rekn ut $\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = 4^{\\frac{1}{2}} = 2$","answer":2}],"solution":"a) 1/3, b) 1/2, c) 1/8, d) 2","hints":["Negativ eksponent betyr invers: a^(-n) = 1/a^n"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Brøkeksponentar og røter**: Samanhengen mellom potenser med brøkeksponent og røter ($a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$)\n- **Generell brøkeksponent**: Tolke og rekne ut $a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m} = (\\sqrt[n]{a})^m$\n- **Potenslover med brøkeksponentar**: Bruke potenslover for multiplikasjon, divisjon og potens av potens\n- **Negative eksponentar**: Rekne ut potenser med negative brøkeksponentar ($a^{-\\frac{m}{n}} = \\frac{1}{a^{\\frac{m}{n}}}$)\n\n### Nøkkelbegrep\n| Begrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Brøkeksponent | Eksponent på forma $\\frac{m}{n}$ som knyt potenser og røter saman |\n| $n$-te rot | $\\sqrt[n]{a} = a^{\\frac{1}{n}}$, talet som opphøgd i $n$ gir $a$ |\n| Negativ eksponent | $a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$, gir den inverse verdien |\n\n### Viktige formlar\n- $a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$\n- $a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = (\\sqrt[n]{a})^m$\n- $a^m \\cdot a^n = a^{m+n}$\n- $\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}$\n- $(a^m)^n = a^{m \\cdot n}$\n- $a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$"},{"id":"10-1-4-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","content":[{"id":"10-1-4-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Skriv om mellom røter og potenser.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Skriv $\\sqrt[4]{5}$ som potens.","solution":"$5^{\\frac{1}{4}}$","expressionAnswer":"5^(1/4)"},{"label":"b","task":"Skriv $x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$ med rottegn.","solution":"$\\sqrt[3]{x^2}$","expressionAnswer":"root(3,x^2)"},{"label":"c","task":"Skriv $\\sqrt{x^5}$ som potens.","solution":"$x^{\\frac{5}{2}}$","expressionAnswer":"x^(5)/(2)"}],"solution":"a) 5^(1/4), b) ³√(x²), c) x^(5/2)","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["n-te rot = eksponent 1/n"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rekn ut potenser med rasjonale eksponentar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Rekn ut $16^{\\frac{1}{4}}$","solution":"$\\sqrt[4]{16} = 2$","answer":2},{"label":"b","task":"Rekn ut $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$","solution":"$(\\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$","answer":4},{"label":"c","task":"Rekn ut $25^{\\frac{3}{2}}$","solution":"$(\\sqrt{25})^3 = 5^3 = 125$","answer":125}],"solution":"a) 2, b) 4, c) 125","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Ta rota først, deretter opphøy"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Forenkla uttrykk med rasjonale eksponentar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Forenkla $x^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$","solution":"$x^{\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{2}{3}} = x^1 = x$","expressionAnswer":"x"},{"label":"b","task":"Forenkla $\\frac{a^{\\frac{5}{4}}}{a^{\\frac{1}{4}}}$","solution":"$a^{\\frac{5}{4} - \\frac{1}{4}} = a^1 = a$","expressionAnswer":"a"},{"label":"c","task":"Forenkla $(x^{\\frac{2}{3}})^3$","solution":"$x^{\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 3} = x^2$","expressionAnswer":"x^2"}],"solution":"a) x, b) a, c) x²","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Bruk potensreglane: legg saman ved gonging, trekk frå ved divisjon"]}},{"id":"10-1-4-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"10-1-4-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Negative og rasjonale eksponentar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Rekn ut $25^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25}} = \\frac{1}{5}$","answer":0.2},{"label":"b","task":"Rekn ut $27^{-\\frac{2}{3}}$","solution":"$\\frac{1}{(\\sqrt[3]{27})^2} = \\frac{1}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"1/9"},{"label":"c","task":"Forenkla $\\frac{x^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\cdot x^{-\\frac{1}{2}}}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^{\\frac{3}{2} - \\frac{1}{2}}}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = \\frac{x^1}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{x}$","expressionAnswer":"sqrt(x)"}],"solution":"a) 1/5, b) 1/9, c) √x","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Negativ eksponent = invers"]}}]}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"2f6b77982797fd74","translatedAt":"2026-06-16T09:38:57.251Z","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","strings":103,"tm":{"af54a29522e64791":"Potensar med rasjonale eksponentar","a841c2c884ca30f5":"Potensar med brøkeksponentar og samanhengen med røter.","6dd93ed5ee7679c6":"bruke variablar og formlar til å uttrykkje samanhengar i praktiske situasjonar","bd5895b177b2dece":"Potensar med brøkeksponentar gir oss ein elegant måte å skrive røter på. Dette knyttar saman potensrekning og rotutdraging.","ec2152f6e2c2c94b":"Rasjonale eksponentar","cb75c5bc94cd5be3":"Ein potens med brøkeksponent definerast slik:\n\n$$a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$$\n\n$$a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m} = (\\sqrt[n]{a})^m$$\n\nFor døme:\n- $8^{\\frac{1}{3}} = \\sqrt[3]{8} = 2$\n- $27^{\\frac{2}{3}} = (\\sqrt[3]{27})^2 = 3^2 = 9$","bc4cd1982af9131b":"Døme 1: Skrive om mellom røter og potensar","eca7c117406fa624":"Skriv om:\na) $\\sqrt{5}$ som potens\nb) $\\sqrt[3]{x^2}$ som potens\nc) $x^{\\frac{3}{4}}$ som rot","f887ac99b50cfcb0":"a) $\\sqrt{5} = 5^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\n\nb) $\\sqrt[3]{x^2} = x^{\\frac{2}{