\frac{a^{\\frac{5}{3}}}{a^{\\frac{2}{3}}}$\nc) $(x^{\\frac{2}{3}})^{\\frac{3}{4}}$","b576462265ada1a1":"a) $x^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{3}{2}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{3}{2}} = x^2$\n\nb) $\\frac{a^{\\frac{5}{3}}}{a^{\\frac{2}{3}}} = a^{\\frac{5}{3} - \\frac{2}{3}} = a^1 = a$\n\nc) $(x^{\\frac{2}{3}})^{\\frac{3}{4}} = x^{\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot \\frac{3}{4}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{x}$","3b09f0ad3bbcc299":"Forenkle uttrykkja.","3d0a039f215f058a":"Forenkle $x^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{1}{3}}$","8eeb484d0bc17324":"$x^{\\frac{2}{3}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{1}{3}} = x^{\\frac{2}{3} + \\frac{1}{3}} = x^1 = x$","2973e375bfaaac8c":"Forenkle $\\frac{a^{\\frac{7}{4}}}{a^{\\frac{3}{4}}}$","f1f9300172431c63":"$\\frac{a^{\\frac{7}{4}}}{a^{\\frac{3}{4}}} = a^{\\frac{7}{4} - \\frac{3}{4}} = a^1 = a$","54cad363043cf59c":"Forenkle $(y^{\\frac{4}{5}})^{\\frac{5}{2}}$","67df3fbbceae6c96":"$(y^{\\frac{4}{5}})^{\\frac{5}{2}} = y^{\\frac{4}{5} \\cdot \\frac{5}{2}} = y^2$","a6b31a96d7d3741c":"Forenkle $x^{\\frac{3}{4}} \\cdot x^{-\\frac{1}{4}}$","9afe77299c6d3f11":"$x^{\\frac{3}{4}} \\cdot x^{-\\frac{1}{4}} = x^{\\frac{3}{4} - \\frac{1}{4}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{x}$","80175e63513aa982":"a) x, b) a, c) y², d) √x","50ad2c80293a1313":"Bruk potenslover: legg saman eksponentar ved multiplikasjon","f46d9ed78fee3b43":"Døme 4: Negative eksponentar","b436a67616518294":"Rekn ut:\na) $4^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$\nb) $27^{-\\frac{2}{3}}$","0a5290aacbbd7372":"a) $4^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{1}{4^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4}} = \\frac{1}{2}$\n\nb) $27^{-\\frac{2}{3}} = \\frac{1}{27^{\\frac{2}{3}}} = \\frac{1}{(\\sqrt[3]{27})^2} = \\frac{1}{3^2} = \\frac{1}{9}$","ca41ea39924a964a":"Rekn ut $9^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$","da1e0f08c88f22c6":"$9^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9}} = \\frac{1}{3}$","27a2b2767c9b1400":"Rekn ut $8^{-\\frac{1}{3}}$","7bbb74a876d28fa1":"$8^{-\\frac{1}{3}} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{8}} = \\frac{1}{2}$","d6cbe54a80ddc7ae":"Rekn ut $16^{-\\frac{3}{4}}$","a09b78b0124faddc":"$16^{-\\frac{3}{4}} = \\frac{1}{16^{\\frac{3}{4}}} = \\frac{1}{8}$","32f6182b3f059db5":"Rekn ut $\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$","4e14c000c8b84c56":"$\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)^{-\\frac{1}{2}} = 4^{\\frac{1}{2}} = 2$","cc6815ad46293467":"a) 1/3, b) 1/2, c) 1/8, d) 2","140c355dfa69fcf3":"Negativ eksponent betyr invers: a^(-n) = 1/a^n","c2d91e0c779de5e7":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Brøkeksponentar og røter**: Samanhengen mellom potenser med brøkeksponent og røter ($a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$)\n- **Generell brøkeksponent**: Tolke og rekne ut $a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a^m} = (\\sqrt[n]{a})^m$\n- **Potenslover med brøkeksponentar**: Bruke potenslover for multiplikasjon, divisjon og potens av potens\n- **Negative eksponentar**: Rekne ut potenser med negative brøkeksponentar ($a^{-\\frac{m}{n}} = \\frac{1}{a^{\\frac{m}{n}}}$)\n\n### Nøkkelbegrep\n| Begrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Brøkeksponent | Eksponent på forma $\\frac{m}{n}$ som knyt potenser og røter saman |\n| $n$-te rot | $\\sqrt[n]{a} = a^{\\frac{1}{n}}$, talet som opphøgd i $n$ gir $a$ |\n| Negativ eksponent | $a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$, gir den inverse verdien |\n\n### Viktige formlar\n- $a^{\\frac{1}{n}} = \\sqrt[n]{a}$\n- $a^{\\frac{m}{n}} = (\\sqrt[n]{a})^m$\n- $a^m \\cdot a^n = a^{m+n}$\n- $\\frac{a^m}{a^n} = a^{m-n}$\n- $(a^m)^n = a^{m \\cdot n}$\n- $a^{-n} = \\frac{1}{a^n}$","f0db7f3333b88fb5":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","cc813884c5a66fe6":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","f1234cc49653c1a9":"Skriv $\\sqrt[4]{5}$ som potens.","a6cc6b5911c6e512":"$5^{\\frac{1}{4}}$","a5287533bca5998e":"Skriv $x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$ med rottegn.","24a170928c91fa82":"$\\sqrt[3]{x^2}$","359717ac57c352a8":"Skriv $\\sqrt{x^5}$ som potens.","1d3b8e6049ad8d92":"$x^{\\frac{5}{2}}$","ec1dc8d82adda347":"a) 5^(1/4), b) ³√(x²), c) x^(5/2)","f202e93595cfd467":"n-te rot = eksponent 1/n","0b2f28024d726460":"Rekn ut potenser med rasjonale eksponentar.","593162ba69eb86d1":"Rekn ut $16^{\\frac{1}{4}}$","2d6e496228b159ec":"$\\sqrt[4]{16} = 2$","0bd0885ae6bf1dcb":"Rekn ut $8^{\\frac{2}{3}}$","f34d35c9aaacef86":"$(\\sqrt[3]{8})^2 = 2^2 = 4$","7c444f7e935767ec":"Rekn ut $25^{\\frac{3}{2}}$","b20488325e44f89f":"$(\\sqrt{25})^3 = 5^3 = 125$","d0fdc5eeee1dbc50":"a) 2, b) 4, c) 125","de348eaefb98ca64":"Ta rota først, deretter opphøy","26f9db876974dd86":"Forenkla uttrykk med rasjonale eksponentar.","4ab650a2f787061b":"Forenkla $x^{\\frac{1}{3}} \\cdot x^{\\frac{2}{3}}$","1ac17242630a5c04":"$x^{\\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{2}{3}} = x^1 = x$","8b47e7d46df7fcdb":"Forenkla $\\frac{a^{\\frac{5}{4}}}{a^{\\frac{1}{4}}}$","21ba2627ed780c07":"$a^{\\frac{5}{4} - \\frac{1}{4}} = a^1 = a$","44d6725fc8816895":"Forenkla $(x^{\\frac{2}{3}})^3$","8d363dad80553a09":"$x^{\\frac{2}{3} \\cdot 3} = x^2$","c06da74f55fec139":"a) x, b) a, c) x²","4000563885c4f612":"Bruk potensreglane: legg saman ved gonging, trekk frå ved divisjon","ce912bb422c8e318":"Negative og rasjonale eksponentar.","e6577846c737ecd2":"Rekn ut $25^{-\\frac{1}{2}}$","da6e5a351305f253":"$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{25}} = \\frac{1}{5}$","5cacb2bd8da38c7b":"Rekn ut $27^{-\\frac{2}{3}}$","9b9292ac62c032ca":"$\\frac{1}{(\\sqrt[3]{27})^2} = \\frac{1}{9}$","e2635c722c016ef9":"Forenkla $\\frac{x^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\cdot x^{-\\frac{1}{2}}}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}}$","02ea8e3f8ee5ff86":"$\\frac{x^{\\frac{3}{2} - \\frac{1}{2}}}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = \\frac{x^1}{x^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = x^{\\frac{1}{2}} = \\sqrt{x}$","e063cd8bccbc081a":"a) 1/5, b) 1/9, c) √x","382e9a72554990cc":"Negativ eksponent = invers"}}}